{"product_id":"postevand-x-sigg-bottle","title":"Postevand x SIGG Bottle","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur reusable bottle is a collaboration with Swiss company SIGG. The bottle is made in Switzerland from one piece of high-quality recycled aluminium sourced in Europe. It is lightweight, durable and free from harmful chemicals including BPA and phthalates. It is made to stay with you for a lifetime and keep you hydrated when you are far away from the tap.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSIGG has been producing high-quality aluminium products since 1908. Since 1993, one of their lightweight and reusable aluminium bottles has been displayed at MoMA in New York.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Postevand","offers":[{"title":"0.40L \/ Aluminium","offer_id":46982181912911,"sku":"56096","price":149.0,"currency_code":"DKK","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1721\/2643\/products\/Sigg-bottle.png?v=1664492987","url":"https:\/\/postevand.com\/products\/postevand-x-sigg-bottle","provider":"Postevand","version":"1.0","type":"link"}